        "original_id": "b339ac1e-d91b-5fc5-8624-1a8d70cf75a8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Melville Shavelson, Armand Schaefer, Cary Grant\n- Works: Houseboat, Yours, Mine and Ours, Hum Hain Rahi Pyar Ke\n- Roles: film director, producer, screenwriter, author\n\nFacts:\n- Armand Schaefer was born on 5 August 1898 and died on 26 September 1967.\n- Melville Shavelson was born on April 1, 1917 and died on August 8, 2007.\n- Armand Schaefer was a Canadian film producer and director.\n- Melville Shavelson was an American film director, producer, screenwriter, and author.\n- Melville Shavelson directed the film Houseboat.\n- Melville Shavelson also directed the original version of Yours, Mine and Ours, released in 1968.\n- Hum Hain Rahi Pyar Ke is described as a copy of the Cary Grant movie Houseboat.",
